---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
---

<Layout title="Switchpath | Find your next right step">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[var(--canvas)] text-[var(--ink)]">
    <Header />
    <section class="grid mx-auto max-w-[1280px] gap-12 px-6 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.02fr_0.98fr] lg:px-10 lg:py-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
        <h1 class="display-title hero-title max-w-3xl">You do not need to know who to call. <span class="text-[#477941]">Just tell us what is happening.</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl">Switchpath explains which professionals may help, in what order, and what to ask next.</p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a href="/onboarding" class="button-primary focus-ring">Start with your situation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="#how-it-works" class="button-secondary focus-ring">See how it works</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cloud" aria-label="Example Switchpath recommendation">
        <div class="hero-bubble hero-bubble-soft hero-sequence-question">Tell us what is changing in your financial life.</div>
        <div class="hero-bubble hero-bubble-dark hero-sequence-response">I’ve started my first proper job, saved $35,000, and might buy an investment property.</div>
        <div class="hero-thinking" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hero-thinking-dot"></span><span class="hero-thinking-dot"></span><span class="hero-thinking-dot"></span></div>
        <div class="hero-recommendation hero-sequence-recommendation"><p class="eyebrow">Your first useful conversation</p><h2>Financial adviser</h2><p>Clarify whether property fits your wider goals before discussing loans or contracts.</p><div class="hero-meta">30–60 min · indicative $195–$250</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
      <section id="how-it-works" class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 py-14 lg:px-10 lg:py-20"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="eyebrow">How Switchpath helps</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4">A calm route through a complicated moment.</h2></div><div class="mt-9 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--line)] md:grid-cols-3"><article class="bg-[var(--raised)] p-6 lg:p-7"><span class="step-number">01</span><svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5.5h14v10H9l-4 3v-13Z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"/></svg><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold">Listen first</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">Answer a few plain-language prompts. Review or edit what Switchpath has captured.</p></article><article class="bg-[var(--raised)] p-6 lg:p-7"><span class="step-number">02</span><svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6h12M6 12h8M6 18h5"/><path d="m16 11 3 3-3 3"/></svg><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold">Explain the order</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">See which roles may help, what each can answer, and what can wait.</p></article><article class="bg-[var(--raised)] p-6 lg:p-7"><span class="step-number">03</span><svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h12"/><path d="m13 7 5 5-5 5"/><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="2"/></svg><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold">Make a next move</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">Compare matched professionals and decide what context you want to share.</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="scenarios" class="bg-[var(--pale)]"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1280px] gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:px-10 lg:py-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">Life events Switchpath can map</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4">Start with the moment, not the job title.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">Switchpath helps you get oriented. Licensed professionals provide the advice that follows.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>01</span><strong>Starting a first well-paid job</strong><small>Build a plan for new income</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>02</span><strong>Thinking about buying property</strong><small>Understand the questions and order</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>03</span><strong>Changing family or dependants</strong><small>Find the right conversations</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/onboarding" class="event-link focus-ring"><span>04</span><strong>Making sense of a new debt</strong><small>See who may help you assess it</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-24"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-[var(--forest)] px-7 py-12 text-white sm:px-12 lg:flex lg:items-end lg:justify-between lg:gap-12"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-dark">Ready when you are</p><h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-serif text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Bring the situation. Switchpath will help with the starting point.</h2></div><a href="/onboarding" class="button-primary mt-8 shrink-0 focus-ring lg:mt-0">Tell Switchpath what is happening <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <footer class="border-t border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--canvas)]"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1280px] flex-col justify-between gap-5 px-6 py-10 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] sm:flex-row lg:px-10"><div><img src="/brand/switchpath-lockup.png" alt="Switchpath" width="2172" height="724" class="block h-10 w-auto -my-2.5" /><p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-xs leading-5">Switchpath guides you to questions and professional roles. It does not provide financial, credit, tax, legal, or investment advice.</p></div><p>© 2026 Switchpath</p></div></footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
